OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum unveils newly restored
OL,4,AWidow of Glencoe painting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA painting depicting the aftermath of
OL,7,Fthe Massacre of Glencoe has been
OL,8,Frestored by Dundee-based conservators.
OL,10,FAlmost 40 members of Clan MacDonald of
OL,11,FGlencoe were killed in February 1692
OL,12,Fafter soldiers were ordered to attack
OL,13,Fthem.
OL,15,FThe painting, known as the Widow of
OL,16,FGlencoe, shows a grieving woman
OL,17,Fstanding next to the body of a man at
OL,18,Fthe foot of a mountain with snow
OL,19,Fcovering the ground.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
